  "Translated for convenience. The English version governs.": "本译文仅供参考，如有歧义，以英文版为准。",
  "September 2026": "2026年9月",
  "1. Acceptance": "1. 接受条款",
  "By using Halo you agree to these terms. Halo is operated by Human Labs. If you do not agree to these terms, do not use Halo.": "您一经使用 Halo，即视为同意本条款。Halo 由 Human Labs 运营。若您不同意本条款，请勿使用 Halo。",
  "2. What Halo does": "2. Halo 提供的服务",
  "Halo reads the receipts you photograph: the shop, the date, the total, and each line on the receipt. It keeps those as your household ledger, and it pools the line items with everyone else’s to work out what groceries cost in your country. You earn points for each receipt you send.": "Halo 读取您拍摄的小票，包括商家、日期、合计金额以及小票上的每一行商品。这些内容会整理成您的家庭账本；各行商品还会与其他用户的记录一并汇总，用于计算您所在国家的食品杂货价格。您每提交一张小票，即可获得积分。",
  "3. Eligibility": "3. 使用资格",
  "You must be 18 or older to use Halo.": "您须年满 18 周岁方可使用 Halo。",
  "4. Your side of it": "4. 用户的义务",
  "Send your own receipts, as printed.": "提交您本人取得的小票，并保持打印时的原样。",
  "Do not send the same receipt twice, and do not alter one before sending it.": "请勿重复提交同一张小票，也不得在提交前加以修改。",
  "Keep your wallet credentials to yourself. Anyone holding them is you, as far as Halo can tell.": "请妥善保管您的钱包凭证，不得告知他人。对 Halo 而言，持有该凭证的人即为您本人。",
  "Use Halo within the law where you are.": "请在您所在地法律允许的范围内使用 Halo。",
  "5. Points": "5. 积分",
  "Points are not transferable and have no cash value. They are recorded against your wallet address on the blockchain your wallet belongs to, which for most users is the chain the app you opened Halo in runs on.": "积分不可转让，亦不具现金价值。积分记录在您的钱包地址之下，所在区块链即该钱包所属的链；对多数用户而言，就是您打开 Halo 所用应用运行的那条链。",
  "Human Labs may change how points are awarded, refuse a receipt that cannot be read or has already been sent, and take back points obtained by sending receipts that are not genuine.": "Human Labs 可以调整积分的发放规则，拒绝无法识别或已提交过的小票，并收回以虚假小票取得的积分。",
  "6. Prices shown to you": "6. 向您展示的价格",
  "The price Halo shows for an item is a median of what other shoppers in your country paid, and it is withheld until enough separate receipts carry that item. It is a description of receipts we have read, not advice, and not a claim about any particular shop.": "Halo 就某一商品显示的价格，是您所在国家其他消费者实际支付金额的中位数；在该商品累计的独立小票数量不足前，我们不予显示。该价格只是对已读取小票的描述，既不构成建议，也不是对任何具体商家的主张。",
  "7. Intellectual property": "7. 知识产权",
  "Halo and everything in it belongs to Human Labs.": "Halo 及其中的全部内容均归 Human Labs 所有。",
  "8. No warranty": "8. 不提供担保",
  "Halo is provided as it is. Human Labs does not promise it will always be available or always correct, and is not responsible for points or data lost to a technical fault.": "Halo 按现状提供。Human Labs 不保证服务始终可用或始终准确，对因技术故障导致的积分或数据丢失不承担责任。",
  "9. Limit of liability": "9. 责任限制",
  "To the extent the law allows, Human Labs is not liable for indirect, incidental, special or consequential damage arising from your use of Halo.": "在法律允许的范围内，Human Labs 对您使用 Halo 所产生的间接损失、附带损失、特殊损失及后果性损失不承担责任。",
  "10. Who operates Halo": "10. 运营主体",
  "Halo is operated by Human Labs. It is not operated by, affiliated with, or endorsed by the wallet or the app store you reached it through.": "Halo 由 Human Labs 运营。您用来打开 Halo 的钱包或应用商店并非 Halo 的运营方，与 Halo 无关联，也未对 Halo 作出背书。",
  "11. Changes": "11. 条款的变更",
  "These terms may change. Continuing to use Halo after a change means you accept it.": "本条款可能变更。变更后您继续使用 Halo，即视为接受变更后的条款。",
  "12. Contact": "12. 联系方式",
  "1. Who we are": "1. 我们是谁",
  "Halo is operated by Human Labs. This policy says what Halo collects, what it does with it, and what you can ask us to do about it.": "Halo 由 Human Labs 运营。本政策说明 Halo 收集哪些信息、如何使用这些信息，以及您可以就此提出哪些要求。",
  "2. What we collect": "2. 我们收集的信息",
  "Your wallet address. It is the only identifier Halo has for you — there is no name, no email and no phone number unless you give us one.": "您的钱包地址。这是 Halo 掌握的唯一身份标识；除非您主动提供，否则我们不会有您的姓名、邮箱和手机号。",
  "The photograph of each receipt you send.": "您提交的每一张小票照片。",
  "What we read off it: the shop, the date, the total, and every line — what was bought, how much of it, and what it cost.": "我们从小票上读取的内容：商家、日期、合计金额，以及每一行商品的品名、数量和金额。",
  "Your point balance and the on-chain transactions that claim it.": "您的积分余额，以及领取积分的链上交易记录。",
  "Which screens you open, so we can tell which parts of Halo are worth keeping.": "您打开了哪些页面。我们据此判断 Halo 的哪些功能值得保留。",
  "3. What we do with it": "3. 信息的用途",
  "Build your ledger — the months, the categories and the prices that are yours.": "生成您的账本：您的月度支出、商品分类，以及您买到的价格。",
  "Award points, and refuse a receipt that has already been sent.": "发放积分，并拦截已经提交过的小票。",
  "Work out what groceries cost in your country, from everyone’s lines together.": "汇总所有用户的商品记录，计算您所在国家的食品杂货价格。",
  "4. The price index": "4. 价格指数",
  "The lines Halo reads off your receipts go into a pool, grouped by country and by item. Nothing identifying you goes with them.": "Halo 从您小票上读取的商品记录，会按国家和商品汇总入库，其中不包含任何可以识别您身份的信息。",
  "A price is only published once enough separate receipts carry that item, so no single shopper’s prices can be read back out of it. Your own receipts are left out of the figure you are compared against — otherwise a frequent buyer would be measured mostly against themselves.": "只有当某一商品累计到足够多的独立小票时，价格才会公开，以确保无法从中反推出任何一位消费者的价格。此外，用来与您比较的基准数字会排除您本人的小票；否则经常购买的人实际上是在和自己比较。",
  "Nobody sees your receipts, your shops or your totals. What other people see is a median, drawn from many households.": "其他人看不到您的小票、您去过的商家或您的消费金额。对外呈现的只是来自众多家庭的中位数。",
  "5. Where it is kept": "5. 存储位置",
  "On Cloudflare infrastructure. Receipt photographs are held in encrypted object storage and are not public.": "存储在 Cloudflare 的基础设施上。小票照片保存在加密的对象存储中，不对外公开。",
  "6. What is on the blockchain": "6. 区块链上的记录",
  "Point claims are recorded on the blockchain your wallet belongs to. That record is public and permanent: your wallet address and the points claimed against it can be read by anyone. Your receipts, their contents and your ledger are not on any blockchain.": "积分领取记录会写入您钱包所属的区块链。该记录公开且永久保存：任何人都可以查到您的钱包地址及其领取的积分。您的小票、小票内容和账本不会写入任何区块链。",
  "7. Who else sees it": "7. 信息的对外提供",
  "We do not sell your information. We share it only with:": "我们不出售您的信息，仅在以下情形下提供：",
  "The providers that run Halo for us — hosting, storage, and the model that reads a receipt.": "受托为我们运行 Halo 的服务商：主机、存储，以及识别小票的模型。",
  "Law enforcement, where the law requires it.": "法律要求时，提供给执法机关。",
  "8. How long we keep it": "8. 保存期限",
  "For as long as your account is in use. Receipt photographs are kept after that as well, because the same receipt being sent twice is the fraud this depends on catching.": "在您的账号处于使用状态期间保存。小票照片在此之后仍会保留，因为识别同一张小票被重复提交，正是本服务必须防范的舞弊行为。",
  "9. What you can ask for": "9. 您的权利",
  "Write to us and you can have a copy of your data, a correction to it, or its deletion. Two things cannot be undone: a point claim already written to a blockchain, and a line already pooled into a published median, which by then is part of a figure with no way back to you.": "来信即可要求获取您数据的副本、更正或删除。但有两件事无法撤销：已经写入区块链的积分领取记录，以及已经汇入公开中位数的商品记录——后者此时已成为无法追溯到您的数字的一部分。",
  "10. Children": "10. 未成年人",
  "Halo is not for anyone under 18, and we do not knowingly collect anything from a child.": "Halo 不面向未满 18 周岁的人群，我们也不会在知情的情况下收集儿童的任何信息。",
  "If this policy changes in a way that matters, Halo will tell you inside the app.": "本政策如有重要变更，Halo 会在应用内告知您。"
}
